  (text "CONTROLBOARD LINK J2 (MEZZANINE), ESD"
    (at 149.86 104.14 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) (bold yes) (color 0 0 132 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4636133a-ab0e-4e3d-b6c5-26e88e34139d")
  )
  (text "ROUTING - LINK\nJ2 on B.Cu with D4 inline beside it; U5, U6 on F.Cu above J2. Each line drops from its J2 pad into the row gap and takes one via\nup (shield and peg holes close the gap ends), then flow-through: ESD pad -> pass-through pad.\nSPI over GND only (never on the In2 power plane); MOSI/CS matched to SCK, MISO not (DESIGN_NOTES §7)."
    (at 152.4 213.36 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 255 0 0 1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "103a9318-923b-488d-ab4e-41264f6e8fd4")
  )
  (text "CONTROLBOARD LINK J2 - Samtec LSHM-110-02.5 on the board's underside, mates ControlBoard2027 J9\n(same part, 5mm stack). The radio hangs off the controlboard's east edge, held only by J2.\nOdd row: 1 EN, 3 DATA_READY, 5 HANDSHAKE, 7 MISO, 11 SCK, 15 MOSI, 19 CS; 9/13/17 GND.\nEven row: 2/4/6 +3V3_HOST, 8-20 GND. SH to GND. Pin p here mates controlboard pin p+1 (odd p) or p-1 (even p).\nControlboard pull-ups/downs: CS pull-up (R29), HANDSHAKE/DATA_READY pull-downs (R31/R32).\nDESIGN_NOTES.md §5."
    (at 152.4 204.47 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5ce553ec-4bc4-4e9d-a8b4-acee5378426d")
  )
